instance (L:Type v) [Inhabited L]:Inhabited (CommutatorRing L):=‹Inhabited L›
instance:LieRing (CommutatorRing L):=inferInstanceAs <| LieRing L
instance:LieAlgebra R (CommutatorRing L):=inferInstanceAs <| LieAlgebra R L
