theorem numerator_Y_degree_bound
    (F:Poly4 K) (c:ℕ) (hc:1 ≤ c)
    (hF:F.degreeOf (1:Fin 4) ≤ c)
    (hH:(polyH K F).degreeOf (1:Fin 4) ≤ c-1)
